dye|n|of Comb ; The act or process of using a comb or a number of combs; as, the combing of one's hair; the combing of wool. ; That which is caught or collected with a comb, as loose, tangled hair. ; Hair arranged to be worn on the head. ; See Coamings.	a:kdm,63,1;nyu,52,1~nyu,52,1;kdm,63,1	v:kdl,67,1~kdl,67,1
