fpy|n|The outer layer of the bark of the cork tree (Quercus Suber), of which stoppers for bottles and casks are made. See Cutose. ; A stopper for a bottle or cask, cut out of cork. ; A mass of tabular cells formed in any kind of bark, in greater or less abundance.	a:21wz,85,2~21wz,85,2	n:21wz,85,2~21wz,85,2
